### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
###  Hospital Management System – API Sample Requests
###  Base URL: http://localhost:8080
###  Compatible with IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
###  USERS  (/api/users)
### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1. Create user – ADMIN
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kamal Joshi",
  "email": "kamal@example.com",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

### 2. Create user – DOCTOR role
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Amit Sharma",
  "email": "amit.sharma@hospital.com",
  "role": "DOCTOR"
}

### 3. Create user – PATIENT role
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rahul Verma",
  "email": "rahul.verma@example.com",
  "role": "PATIENT"
}

### 4. Get all users
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users

### 5. Get users filtered by role
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?role=DOCTOR

### 6. Get user by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1

### 7. Update user
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kamal Joshi (Updated)",
  "email": "kamal.updated@example.com",
  "role": "SUPER_ADMIN"
}

### 8. Delete user
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1

### 9. Edge case – duplicate email (should return 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Duplicate Person",
  "email": "kamal@example.com",
  "role": "PATIENT"
}

### 10. Edge case – validation failure (blank name)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "role": "PATIENT"
}

### 11. Edge case – invalid email format
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "role": "PATIENT"
}

### 12. Edge case – user not found
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/99999


### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
###  DOCTORS  (/api/doctors)
### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 13. Create doctor – General Physician (with linked userId)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "name": "Dr. Amit Sharma",
  "email": "amit.sharma@example.com",
  "phone": "9000000001",
  "specialization": "General Physician",
  "qualification": "MBBS, MD (Internal Medicine)",
  "experienceYears": 10,
  "consultationFee": 600.00,
  "rating": 4.8,
  "totalReviews": 128,
  "bio": "Experienced general physician specializing in preventive healthcare, lifestyle diseases, diabetes management, and chronic illness care.",
  "image": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1622253692010-333f2da6031d?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=400",
  "available": true,
  "workingDays": ["Monday", "Tuesday", "Wednesday", "Thursday", "Friday", "Saturday"],
  "workingHoursStart": "09:00",
  "workingHoursEnd": "17:00",
  "slotDurationMinutes": 30
}

