### 18. Get all doctors
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors

### 19. Get only available doctors
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors?available=true

### 20. Filter by specialization
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors?specialization=Cardiologist

### 21. Search doctors by name or specialization
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors?q=neuro

### 22. Get doctor by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors/1

### 23. Get doctor by linked user ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors/user/2

### 24. Update doctor
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Dr. Amit Sharma",
  "email": "amit.sharma@example.com",
  "phone": "9000000001",
  "specialization": "General Physician",
  "qualification": "MBBS, MD (Internal Medicine), Fellowship in Diabetes",
  "experienceYears": 11,
  "consultationFee": 650.00,
  "rating": 4.8,
  "totalReviews": 135,
  "bio": "Updated bio for Dr. Amit Sharma.",
  "image": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1622253692010-333f2da6031d?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=400",
  "available": true,
  "workingDays": ["Monday", "Tuesday", "Wednesday", "Thursday", "Friday", "Saturday"],
  "workingHoursStart": "09:00",
  "workingHoursEnd": "17:00",
  "slotDurationMinutes": 30
}

### 24. Toggle doctor availability to false
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors/1/availability
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "available": false
}

### 25. Toggle doctor availability back to true
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors/1/availability
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "available": true
}

### 26. Delete doctor
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors/6

