###  APPOINTMENTS  (/api/appointments)
### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 51. Book appointment – patient 1, doctor 1, In-Person
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": 1,
  "doctorId": 1,
  "appointmentDate": "2026-11-02",
  "startTime": "10:00",
  "endTime": "10:30",
  "reason": "General health checkup & blood sugar review",
  "consultationType": "IN_PERSON"
}

### 52. Book appointment – patient 1, doctor 2, Online
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": 1,
  "doctorId": 2,
  "appointmentDate": "2026-11-12",
  "startTime": "14:30",
  "endTime": "15:00",
  "reason": "Cardiology screening & ECG discussion",
  "consultationType": "ONLINE"
}

