### 55. Get all appointments
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments

### 56. Get appointments filtered by patient
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments?patientId=1

### 57. Get appointments filtered by doctor
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments?doctorId=1

