GET {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments?doctorId=1&date=2026-11-02

### 59. Get appointments by patient and status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments?patientId=1&status=CONFIRMED

### 60. Get appointment by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments/1

### 61. Get appointments for a specific patient (clean path)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments/patient/1

### 62. Get appointments for a specific doctor (clean path)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments/doctor/1

### 63. Get doctor's appointments for today
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments/doctor/1/today

